      "content": "I get what you're saying about the filter being flawed, and you're right, it's not a perfect measure of quality. But I can't really change how their system works right now, I just have to work with what I've got to get this through the first stage.\n\nIf we can just get past the automated filter, the human board will see the actual value. So, let's just try to find a balance. Can you go ahead and write that \"Community Impact\" section now? Try to weave the word \"citizen\" in naturally where it makes sense so we don't tank the score, but keep the tone professional and high-quality like you mentioned. I really need a solid draft to work from.",
